    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109526" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποφρίσσω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποφόρ-ττω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be rather bristly,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γενειὰς ὑποφρίττουσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.Jun.
					<u>Im.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			; <i>shudder a little,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Peregr.</u>
				39
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>JConf.</u>
				4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pr.Im.</u>
				12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				12.68
			</span></i>; of an artery, <i><span class="en">
				Archig.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				8.90
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. acc.,
				<i>feel dread before</i> or <i>of,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Euph.
				78
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>UP</u>
				14.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>bristle,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολιῇσιν ἐθείραις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					35.55
				</span></i>
			.</div>
